y=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"m8.5 12 2.5 2.5 4.5-5\"/></svg>\n    <p><strong>{{s97}}</strong> {{s98}} <a href=\"{{u99}}\" data-track=\"sector-insurance-talk-success-phone\">{{s100}}</a></p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n      <a class=\"sx-talk__call\" href=\"{{u101}}\" data-track=\"sector-insurance-talk-phone\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2Z\"/></svg><span>{{s102}} <strong>{{s103}}</strong></span></a>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n</div>","uses":1,"slots":[{"k":"s0","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"01"},{"k":"s1","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"Built for insurance"},{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"Technology insurance teams can rely on"},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"Insurance businesses handle large volumes of sensitive client and policy data under regulatory scrutiny, and depend on systems being available to serve clients."},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"WhizzIT protects your data, supports your compliance obligations and keeps your systems resilient and secure, with cyber security built into everything we do."},{"k":"s5","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"02"},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 6","default":"What you get with WhizzIT"},{"k":"s7","type":"s","label":"Heading 2","default":"What you get with WhizzIT"},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"01"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"Protection for sensitive client and policy data"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"List item 3","default":"02"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"List item 4","default":"Support for regulatory and compliance requirements"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"List item 5","default":"03"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"List item 6","default":"Resilient, always-on systems"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"List item 7","default":"04"},{"k":"s15","type":"s","label":"List item 8","default":"Secure remote and hybrid working"},{"k":"s16","type":"s","label":"List item 9","default":"05"},{"k":"s17","type":"s","label":"List item 10","default":"Advanced cyber security and monitoring"},{"k":"s18","type":"s","label":"List item 11","default":"06"},{"k":"s19","type":"s","label":"List item 12","default":"Backup and disaster recovery procedures"},{"k":"s20","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 7","default":"03"},{"k":"s21","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 8","default":"Brokers, MGAs and insurers"},{"k":"s22","type":"s","label":"Heading 3","default":"The resilience you sell is the resilience you are judged on"},{"k":"s23","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 9","default":"Insurance businesses hold an unusual concentration of sensitive personal data and, in health and protection lines, special-category data too. They also occupy an awkward position: a broker whose systems are down is unavailable at exactly the moment a client needs to notify a claim."},{"k":"s24","type":"s","label":"List item 13","default":"01"},{"k":"s25","type":"s","label":"Heading 4","default":"Claims and renewal peaks are not evenly spread"},{"k":"s26","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 10","default":"Workload arrives in bursts around renewal dates and after weather events, and capacity has to be there on the day rather than on average. Monitoring that only reports monthly uptime will miss the hour that actually mattered."},{"k":"s27","type":"s","label":"List item 14","default":"02"},{"k":"s28","type":"s","label":"Heading 5","default":"Broker platforms and insurer portals are the working day"},{"k":"s29","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 11","default":"Quoting, binding and claims handling all run through a mix of broker software and insurer extranets, each with its own authentication and browser quirks. Keeping that estate stable, patched and accessible is most of the practical support work in this sector."},{"k":"s30","type":"s","label":"List item 15","default":"03"},{"k":"s31","type":"s","label":"Heading 6","default":"Special-category data raises the bar on access"},{"k":"s32","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 12","default":"Where medical or health information is held, the standard for who can see what stops being a matter of tidiness and becomes a matter of lawful basis. Role-based access, logging and reviewed permissions are the mechanics that make that defensible."},{"k":"s33","type":"s","label":"List item 16","default":"04"},{"k":"s34","type":"s","label":"Heading 7","default":"Delegated authority means someone else’s data on your systems"},{"k":"s35","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 13","default":"MGAs and brokers operating under delegated authority hold data the insurer remains accountable for, which means the insurer’s own assurance requirements land on your infrastructure. Expect questions about encryption, retention periods, sub-processors and breach notification timelines, and expect them in a questionnaire rather than a conversation. Having those answers documented in advance turns a two-week scramble into an afternoon."},{"k":"s36","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 14","default":"04"},{"k":"s37","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 15","default":"Customer stories"},{"k":"s38","type":"s","label":"Heading 8","default":"What our clients say"},{"k":"s39","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 16","default":"Great IT support company. The WhizzIT team are professional, responsive and easy to work with. Any issues are dealt with quickly and they are never slow to pick up the phone."},{"k":"s40","type":"s","label":"Caption 1","default":"TS"},{"k":"s41","type":"s","label":"Bold text 1","default":"Tommy Sabine"},{"k":"s42","type":"s","label":"Caption 2","default":"Director, Codeshield"},{"k":"u43","type":"u","label":"Link: See all 15 reviews","default":"https://www.google.com/maps?cid=17055157413191665489"},{"k":"s44","type":"s","label":"Link text 1","default":"See all 15 reviews"},{"k":"s45","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 17","default":"05"},{"k":"s46","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 18","default":"What we do"},{"k":"s47","type":"s","label":"Heading 9","default":"Everything IT, under one roof"},{"k":"s48","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 19","default":"From day-to-day support to cyber security and full projects, we take care of the technology so your team can focus on the work that matters."},{"k":"u49","type":"u","label":"Link: IT Support","default":"/it-support/"},{"k":"s50","type":"s","label":"Bold text 2","default":"IT Support"},{"k":"s51","type":"s","label":"Link text 2","default":"Fast, friendly help when things go wrong."},{"k":"u52","type":"u","label":"Link: Managed Cloud Services","default":"/managed-cloud-services/"},{"k":"s53","type":"s","label":"Bold text 3","default":"Managed Cloud Services"},{"k":"s54","type":"s","label":"Link text 3","default":"Microsoft 365, Azure and Google Workspace, managed end to end."},{"k":"u55","type":"u","label":"Link: Cyber Security","default":"/cyber-security/"},{"k":"s56","type":"s","label":"Bold text 4","default":"Cyber Security"},{"k":"s57","type":"s","label":"Link text 4","default":"Protection aligned to Cyber Essentials best practice."},{"k":"u58","type":"u","label":"Link: Network Management","default":"/network-management/"},{"k":"s59","type":"s","label":"Bold text 5","default":"Network Management"},{"k":"s60","type":"s","label":"Link text 5","default":"Networks designed, built and monitored by our engineers."},{"k":"u61","type":"u","label":"Link: IT Project Management","default":"/it-project-management/"},{"k":"s62","type":"s","label":"Bold text 6","default":"IT Project Management"},{"k":"s63","type":"s","label":"Link text 6","default":"Moves, migrations and upgrades delivered on time."},{"k":"u64","type":"u","label":"Link: All IT services","default":"/it-services/"},{"k":"s65","type":"s","label":"Button 1","default":"All IT services"},{"k":"s66","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 20","default":"06"},{"k":"s67","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 21","default":"Certified & accredited"},{"k":"s68","type":"s","label":"Heading 10","default":"Credentials you can check"},{"k":"i69","type":"i","label":"Image 1","default":{"html":"<img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/partners/cyber-essentials.webp\" alt=\"Cyber Essentials certified\" width=\"280\" height=\"110\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/partners/cyber-essentials.webp"}},{"k":"s70","type":"s","label":"Heading 11","default":"Cyber Essentials certified"},{"k":"s71","type":"s","label":"List item 17","default":"Independently assessed against the UK government-backed scheme, so our security fundamentals are verified rather than simply claimed. We help clients certify too."},{"k":"u72","type":"u","label":"Link: How Cyber Essentials helps you","default":"/cyber-security/cyber-essentials-services/"},{"k":"s73","type":"s","label":"Link text 7","default":"How Cyber Essentials helps you"},{"k":"i74","type":"i","label":"Image 2","default":{"html":"<img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/partners/microsoft-csp.webp\" alt=\"Microsoft Cloud Solution Provider\" width=\"280\" height=\"110\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/partners/microsoft-csp.webp"}},{"k":"s75","type":"s","label":"Heading 12","default":"Microsoft Cloud Solution Provider"},{"k":"s76","type":"s","label":"List item 18","default":"A direct partnership with Microsoft. We license, deploy and support Microsoft 365 and Azure for you, with escalation straight to Microsoft when it is needed."},{"k":"u77","type":"u","label":"Link: Our Microsoft cloud services","default":"/managed-cloud-services/"},{"k":"s78","type":"s","label":"Link text 8","default":"Our Microsoft cloud services"},{"k":"i79","type":"i","label":"Image 3","default":{"html":"<img sr